  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "楊桃ke味緒"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">吳瑞琪</span></span><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b>\n<b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.4153449113946408\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">日頭lâu月光談戀愛<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Ngit-thèu lâu ngia̍t-kông thàm lien-oi</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">拜託星仔傳情書<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Pai-thok sên-é chhòn chhìn-sû</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">一陣ngiap-lang打雷公<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Yit-chhṳn ngiap-lang tá lùi-kûng</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">點點星光跌落大安河<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Tiám-tiám sên-kông tiet-lo̍k Thai-ôn-hò</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></b><br />\n<a name='more'></a><b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.4153449113946408\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">蜂糖甜个河水<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Fûng-thòng thiàm ke hò-suí</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">灌注白布帆个大地<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Kon-chu pha̍k-pu-fàm ke thai-thi</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">樹頭<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Su-thèu</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">竄出一粒粒个青綠<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Chhon-chhut yit-lia̍p-lia̍p ke chhiâng-liu̍k</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">借農家个手<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Chia nùng-kâ ke sú</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">牽線<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Khiân-sien</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">日頭lâu月光因此<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Ngit-thèu lâu ngia̍t-kông yîn-chṳ</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">結成正果<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Kiat sṳ̀n chṳn-kó</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">長圓个身形橫切<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Chhòng-yàn ke sṳ̂n-hìn vàng-chhiet</span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b>\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">一片一片个星é果<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Yit-phién yit-phién ke sên-é-kó</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">係做得入嘴个愛語<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />He cho-tet ngi̍p-choi ke oi-ngî</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">講等戀人个誓言<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Kóng-tén lien-ngìn ke sṳ-ngiàn</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">甜入心<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Thiàm ngi̍p sîm</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></b><b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">送心愛个佢</span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Sung sîm-oi ke kì</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">一粒果子做情書<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Yit-lia̍p kó-chṳ́ cho chhìn-sû</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">字字寫等<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Sṳ-sṳ siá-tén</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">不變个情意<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Put-pien ke chhìn-yi</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">如日月星个永恆<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Yì ngit-ngia̍t-sên ke yún-hèn</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">大安河千年个水流<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Thai-ôn-hò chhiên-ngiàn ke súi-liù</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">見證<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Kian-chṳn</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">倆儕<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Lióng-sà</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">天長地久个愛情<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Thiên-chhòng thi-kiú ke oi-chhìn</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">註解：</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">1. lâu：kap。2. ngiap-lang：sih-nà，『閃電』。3. 倆儕：兩个人。</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（客語顧問邱淑華做文字整理kap加註解）</span></b>"
  },
